menu "XiaoTai application"
config XIAOTAI_DISCOVERY_URL
    string "ThingConnect service discovery URL"
    default "http://ep-open.tangeopen.com/services"
    help
        Existing development endpoint is retained. Override for your deployment.
        HTTPS requires valid time, trusted certificates and sufficient TLS memory.
config XIAOTAI_DEVELOPMENT_CONSOLE
    bool "Enable local development command console"
    default n
    help
        Development only: enables serial commands that can alter credentials
        and inject session actions. Product builds keep logs and BOOT wake,
        but do not create this command task.
config XIAOTAI_PORTAL_URL
    string "Device binding portal URL (display only)"
    default "https://demo-open.tange-ai.com"
config XIAOTAI_WAKE_THRESHOLD_MILLI
    int "Voicute wake threshold (thousandths)"
    range 50 990
    default 700
    help
        Model-specific; requires acoustic validation. Console overrides are volatile.
config XIAOTAI_CAPTURE_AGC
    bool "Adaptive uplink gain after AEC"
    default y
    help
        ESP-SR WebRTC digital AGC with limiter. Does not modify the AEC
        reference or codec gain. Adds a fixed 10 ms streaming delay.
config XIAOTAI_WAKE_CAPTURE_AGC
    bool "Use post-AEC adaptive gain for wake input"
    depends on XIAOTAI_CAPTURE_AGC
    default y
    help
        Share the existing 16 kHz AGC output before uplink downsampling.
        No second AGC, added task or audio buffer. Preserve the model and
        threshold and account for the 10 ms AGC delay in wake timestamps.
config XIAOTAI_CAPTURE_AGC_GAIN_DB
    int "Uplink AGC compression gain (dB)"
    range 0 18 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    range 0 12
    default 15 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    default 9
    help
        WebRTC compression gain, not a fixed volume multiplier. The target is
        -6 dBFS. The S3 default adds 6 dB of gain allowance compared with 9 dB;
        the limiter still protects loud input. More gain also amplifies residual
        echo and noise. The P4 default is unchanged.
endmenu
